# Source Documents

These files in the project root are the sitemap and to-do list for the prototype:

- `Azercell_Sitemap.md` — full page tree for B2C, B2B, About Us, and external destinations
- `Azercell_Database_B2C.md`, `Azercell_Database_B2B.md`, `Azercell_Database_Other.md` — real
  product names, prices, and descriptions to use as content
- `Azercell_B2C_Functionality_ToDo.md`, `Azercell_B2B_Functionality_ToDo.md` — required
  functionality, including items marked deprioritized or undecided
- `Azercell_Value_Propositions_*.md` — messaging

## Always ask first

Never build a page, section, or feature from these documents on your own initiative. Ask the
user before implementing anything found in them, and name the document and item.

Items marked with the future/deprioritized marker or the open-question marker in the to-do
files must never be built without the user explicitly asking.

## Use them for content

When the user has approved a page, take names, prices, and descriptions from the database files
rather than inventing content. Prices are in AZN. Keep the real product names.
